### REST client routes for the contacts API

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Home page
GET http://localhost:3001
Accept: text/html

### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:3001/
Accept: application/json

### Get one contact by id
GET http://localhost:3001/6a0dfe505b413bcf50ba2e3f
Accept: application/json

### Create a new contact
POST http://localhost:3001/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

 {
    "firstName": "Fatima",
    "lastName": "Diallo",
    "email": "fatima-diallo@gmail.com",
    "favoriteColor": "red",
    "birthday": "2003-08-15"
  }

### Update a contact by id
PUT http://localhost:3001/6a0c20bb9d57c87818cf1337 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

 {
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Utah",
    "email": "johnupdated@gmail.com",
    "favoriteColor": "blue",
    "birthday": "1995-04-23"
  }

### Delete a contact by id
DELETE http://localhost:3001/6a0bbd7a7478d8d738302ec8

### Render HTML contacts list
GET http://localhost:3001/
Accept: text/html
